{"step_index":161,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T08:51:12Z","input_tokens":4000,"cache_read_tokens":226345,"output_tokens":5750,"thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nThe design focuses on a mobile-first, vertical layout. It will use a 6-column structure, each sized for comfortable thumb interaction, preventing accidental mis-taps. Cards within each column will overlap, creating a pixel art effect, with the bottom card in each column featuring a larger, easily readable badge displaying a count (e.g., \"5 / 8\"). A dedicated, larger waiting slot will appear below, also with a badge.\n\n\nThe mobile interface adopts a vertical orientation with a 6-column structure optimized for thumb interaction. A high-resolution pixel art canvas (10x12 or 8x12 grid) at the top will depict a Mario mushroom, with rows dynamically \"falling\" into five wide, vertically arranged columns below. Each of these columns will display overlapping cards with clear, large badges on the bottom card, indicating counts. A dedicated waiting slot at the bottom will also feature a badge to show the number of waiting cards.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import os\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont\n\nfont_title = ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeuib.ttf', 18)\nfont_sub = ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeui.ttf', 12)\nfont_card_num = ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeuib.ttf', 15)\nfont_badge = ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeuib.ttf', 11)\nfont_sm = ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeui.ttf', 11)\n\nPALETTE = {\n    'B': {'fill': (15, 23, 42),    'border': (51, 65, 85),    'text': '#ffffff', 'name': 'Xanh Đêm'},\n    'R': {'fill': (239, 68, 68),   'border': (185, 28, 28),   'text': '#ffffff', 'name': 'Đỏ'},\n    'W': {'fill': (248, 250, 252), 'border': (148, 163, 184), 'text': '#0f172a', 'name': 'Trắng'},\n    'S': {'fill': (254, 215, 170), 'border': (217, 119, 6),   'text': '#7c2d12', 'name': 'Da'},\n    'D': {'fill': (24, 24, 27),    'border': (82, 82, 91),    'text': '#ffffff', 'name': 'Đen'},\n    'G': {'fill': (34, 197, 94),   'border': (21, 128, 61),   'text': '#052e16', 'name': 'Xanh Lá'},\n    'Y': {'fill': (234, 179, 8),   'border': (161, 98, 7),    'text': '#422006', 'name': 'Vàng'}\n}\n\n# ==============================================================================\n# CÁCH 1: 6 CỘT RỘNG RÃI (58px) + NÉN PIXEL 14px + LÁ ĐÁY TÁCH NHẸ GHI SỐ (k/8)\n# ==============================================================================\ndef render_cach_1(out_path):\n    W, H = 440, 780\n    img = Image.new('RGB', (W, H), '#06170d')\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\n\n    # Mobile Frame\n    d.rounded_rectangle([10, 10, W - 10, H - 10], radius=32, fill='#114b29', outline='#082614', width=5)\n    d.rounded_rectangle([16, 16, W - 16, H - 16], radius=28, fill='#145a32', outline='#0d3d22', width=2)\n\n    # Header\n    d.text((28, 26), \"CÁCH 1: 6 CỘT LỚN + LÁ ĐÁY GHI SỐ\", fill='#fef08a', font=font_title)\n    d.text((28, 50), \"Cột rộng 58px dễ bấm · Thân trên nén 14px làm Pixel · Đáy hiện k/Target\", fill='#86efac', font=font_sub)\n\n    # 6x16 Pixel Art (Cute Mushroom adapted to 6 wide columns)\n    grid_6x16 = [\n        'BBRRBB',\n        'BRRRRB',\n        'RWWWWR',\n        'RWWWWR',\n        'RWWRWR',\n        'RRRRRR',\n        'RRRRRR',\n        'BSSSSB',\n        'BSDSSB',\n        'BSDSSB',\n        'BSSSSB',\n        'BGGGGB',\n        'GGGGGG',\n        'GGGGGG',\n        'GGYYGG',\n        'GYGYYG'  # Bottom row with varied stacks to show counters!\n    ]\n    # Bottom group counts simulated for visual demo:\n    bottom_counts = [\n        ('G', 4, 8),\n        ('Y', 5, 8),\n        ('G', 2, 8),\n        ('Y', 3, 8),\n        ('Y', 2, 8),\n        ('G', 3, 8)\n    ]\n\n    CARD_W = 58\n    COL_GAP = 6\n    STEP_Y = 15\n    BOTTOM_CARD_H = 68\n    LEFT_X = (W - (6 * CARD_W + 5 * COL_GAP)) // 2\n    START_Y = 92\n\n    # Draw 6 columns\n    for col_idx in range(6):\n        cx = LEFT_X + col_idx * (CARD_W + COL_GAP)\n        d.text((cx + 20, START_Y - 18), f\"C{col_idx+1}\", fill='#86efac', font=font_sm)\n\n        # Draw upper 15 rows as tight pixel cards (15px step)\n        for row_idx in range(15):\n            ck = grid_6x16[row_idx][col_idx]\n            c = PALETTE[ck]\n            cy = START_Y + row_idx * STEP_Y\n            # Shadow\n            d.rounded_rectangle([cx + 1, cy + 2, cx + CARD_W + 1, cy + 26], radius=5, fill=(0, 0, 0, 90))\n            # Card body\n            d.rounded_rectangle([cx, cy, cx + CARD_W, cy + 24], radius=5, fill=c['fill'], outline=c['border'], width=1)\n\n        # Draw bottom playable card (slightly separated Touch Pad with Counter Badge!)\n        b_color, cur_k, target_k = bottom_counts[col_idx]\n        c = PALETTE[b_color]\n        by = START_Y + 15 * STEP_Y + 6\n        # Drop shadow\n        d.rounded_rectangle([cx + 2, by + 5, cx + CARD_W + 2, by + BOTTOM_CARD_H + 5], radius=8, fill=(0, 0, 0, 140))\n        # Full bottom card\n        d.rounded_rectangle([cx, by, cx + CARD_W, by + BOTTOM_CARD_H], radius=8, fill=c['fill'], outline='#ffffff', width=2)\n\n        # Counter Badge right in the center of the bottom card!\n        badge_w, badge_h = 46, 26\n        bx = cx + (CARD_W - badge_w) // 2\n        b_y = by + (BOTTOM_CARD_H - badge_h) // 2 - 4\n        d.rounded_rectangle([bx, b_y, bx + badge_w, b_y + badge_h], radius=8, fill='#091e11', outline='#facc15', width=1)\n        d.text((bx + 7, b_y + 3), f\"{cur_k}/{target_k}\", fill='#fef08a', font=font_card_num)\n\n        # Mini progress bar at bottom of card\n        bar_w = CARD_W - 12\n        fill_w = int(bar_w * (cur_k / target_k))\n        d.rounded_rectangle([cx + 6, by + BOTTOM_CARD_H - 12, cx + 6 + bar_w, by + BOTTOM_CARD_H - 6], radius=3, fill='#00000066')\n        d.rounded_rectangle([cx + 6, by + BOTTOM_CARD_H - 12, cx + 6 + fill_w, by + BOTTOM_CARD_H - 6], radius=3, fill='#4ade80')\n\n    # Callout explaining the visual math\n    callout_y = START_Y + 15 * STEP_Y + BOTTOM_CARD_H + 22\n    d.rounded_rectangle([28, callout_y, W - 28, callout_y + 52], radius=10, fill='#0a2e18', outline='#4ade80', width=1)\n    d.text((40, callout_y + 8), \"💡 Nhìn C2 (5/8) và C4 (3/8): Người chơi không cần đếm gáy bài!\", fill='#fef08a', font=font_badge)\n    d.text((40, callout_y + 27), \"Chỉ cần thấy 5/8 + 3/8 = 8/8 ➔ Bấm C2 ghép sang C4 là NỔ NGAY!\", fill='#86efac', font=font_sm)\n\n    # Single Multi-Card Holding Slot at bottom\n    slot_y = callout_y + 72\n    d.text((W // 2 - 115, slot_y - 20), \"📥 1 SLOT CHỜ DUY NHẤT (Cùng màu)\", fill='#bbf7d0', font=font_badge)\n    slot_w, slot_h = 150, 72\n    sx = (W - slot_w) // 2\n    d.rounded_rectangle([sx, slot_y, sx + slot_w, slot_y + slot_h], radius=10, fill=PALETTE['R']['fill'], outline='#ffffff', width=2)\n    d.text((sx + 16, slot_y + 14), \"Đỏ (Đang giữ)\", fill='#ffffff', font=font_badge)\n    d.text((sx + 16, slot_y + 34), \"Target: min(8, Còn lại)\", fill='#fecaca', font=font_sm)\n    d.rounded_rectangle([sx + 92, slot_y + 18, sx + 138, slot_y + 48], radius=8, fill='#091e11', outline='#facc15', width=1)\n    d.text((sx + 99, slot_y + 22), \"3/8\", fill='#fef08a', font=font_card_num)\n\n    # Footer\n    d.text((28, H - 38), \"• Ưu điểm Cách 1: Giữ nguyên chất bài Solitaire, vùng bấm rộng 58px chuẩn Mobile.\", fill='#86efac', font=font_sm)\n\n    img.save(out_path, quality=95)\n\n\n# ==============================================================================\n# CÁCH 2: KHUNG TRANH PIXEL (10x12) Ở TRÊN + 5 CỘT BÀI SIÊU TO (68px) Ở DƯỚI\n# ==============================================================================\ndef render_cach_2(out_path):\n    W, H = 440, 780\n    img = Image.new('RGB', (W, H), '#06170d')\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\n\n    # Mobile Frame\n    d.rounded_rectangle([10, 10, W - 10, H - 10], radius=32, fill='#114b29', outline='#082614', width=5)\n    d.rounded_rectangle([16, 16, W - 16, H - 16], radius=28, fill='#145a32', outline='#0d3d22', width=2)\n\n    # Header\n    d.text((28, 26), \"CÁCH 2: TRANH PIXEL TRÊN + 5 CỘT DƯỚI\", fill='#fef08a', font=font_title)\n    d.text((28, 50), \"Tranh Pixel 10×10 siêu nét ở trên · Rơi xuống 5 Cột Bài 68px cực rộng ở dưới\", fill='#86efac', font=font_sub)\n\n    # 1. Upper Pixel Art Canvas Frame (10x10 square pixels)\n    CANVAS_W = 240\n    CANVAS_H = 225\n    CANVAS_X = (W - CANVAS_W) // 2\n    CANVAS_Y = 82\n    d.rounded_rectangle([CANVAS_X - 8, CANVAS_Y - 8, CANVAS_X + CANVAS_W + 8, CANVAS_Y + CANVAS_H + 8], radius=12, fill='#092614', outline='#facc15', width=2)\n\n    grid_10x10 = [\n        'BBBRRRRBBB',\n        'BBRRRRRRBB',\n        'BRWWWRRWRB',\n        'RWWWWRRWWR',\n        'RWWWWRRWWR',\n        'RRRRRRRRRR',\n        'BSSSSSSSSB',\n        'BSSDSSDSSB',\n        'BSSDSSDSSB',\n        'BBGGGGGGGB'\n    ]\n    PX_SIZE = 21\n    PX_GAP = 2\n    start_px_x = CANVAS_X + (CANVAS_W - (10 * PX_SIZE + 9 * PX_GAP)) // 2\n    start_px_y = CANVAS_Y + 6\n\n    for r in range(10):\n        for c in range(10):\n            ck = grid_10x10[r][c]\n            col_info = PALETTE[ck]\n            px = start_px_x + c * (PX_SIZE + PX_GAP)\n            py = start_px_y + r * (PX_SIZE + PX_GAP)\n            d.rounded_rectangle([px, py, px + PX_SIZE, py + PX_SIZE], radius=3, fill=col_info['fill'], outline=col_info['border'], width=1)\n\n    # Dispenser arrows showing pixels dropping into the 5 wide columns\n    arrow_y = CANVAS_Y + CANVAS_H + 14\n    d.text((W // 2 - 115, arrow_y), \"▼ Pixel rơi xuống 5 Cột Bài thao tác ▼\", fill='#fef08a', font=font_badge)\n\n    # 2. Lower 5 Extra-Wide Playable Columns (68px wide each!)\n    COL_W = 68\n    COL_GAP = 8\n    COLS_LEFT = (W - (5 * COL_W + 4 * COL_GAP)) // 2\n    COLS_TOP = arrow_y + 26\n\n    cols_data = [\n        (['R', 'G', 'Y', 'Y'], 5, 8),\n        (['B', 'S', 'D'], 2, 4),      # Dark eye only has 4 total cards -> Target = 4!\n        (['W', 'R', 'G', 'G'], 6, 8),\n        (['S', 'B', 'Y'], 3, 8),\n        (['R', 'W', 'G'], 2, 8)\n    ]\n\n    for c_idx, (stack, cur_k, target_k) in enumerate(cols_data):\n        cx = COLS_LEFT + c_idx * (COL_W + COL_GAP)\n        # Stack cards with comfortable 22px spacing\n        for s_i, ck in enumerate(stack):\n            c_info = PALETTE[ck]\n            cy = COLS_TOP + s_i * 22\n            is_last = (s_i == len(stack) - 1)\n            h = 74 if is_last else 40\n            d.rounded_rectangle([cx + 2, cy + 4, cx + COL_W + 2, cy + h + 4], radius=8, fill=(0, 0, 0, 120))\n            d.rounded_rectangle([cx, cy, cx + COL_W, cy + h], radius=8, fill=c_info['fill'], outline='#ffffff' if is_last else c_info['border'], width=2 if is_last else 1)\n\n            if is_last:\n                # Counter Badge on the wide bottom card\n                bw, bh = 52, 28\n                bx = cx + (COL_W - bw) // 2\n                by = cy + (h - bh) // 2 - 4\n                d.rounded_rectangle([bx, by, bx + bw, by + bh], radius=8, fill='#091e11', outline='#facc15', width=1)\n                d.text((bx + 10, by + 4), f\"{cur_k}/{target_k}\", fill='#fef08a', font=font_card_num)\n\n                # Progress bar\n                bar_w = COL_W - 14\n                fill_w = int(bar_w * (cur_k / target_k))\n                d.rounded_rectangle([cx + 7, cy + h - 12, cx + 7 + bar_w, cy + h - 6], radius=3, fill='#00000066')\n                d.rounded_rectangle([cx + 7, cy + h - 12, cx + 7 + fill_w, cy + h - 6], radius=3, fill='#4ade80')\n\n    # Note about Column 2 (2/4 for rare color)\n    note_y = COLS_TOP + 175\n    d.rounded_rectangle([28, note_y, W - 28, note_y + 48], radius=10, fill='#0a2e18', outline='#4ade80', width=1)\n    d.text((40, note_y + 7), \"💡 Xem Cột 2 (Màu Đen - Mắt nấm): Toàn tranh chỉ có 4 viên Đen\", fill='#fef08a', font=font_badge)\n    d.text((40, note_y + 25), \"➔ Mục tiêu tự động là 2/4 (gom đủ 4 lá là Clear, không cần đủ 8)!\", fill='#86efac', font=font_sm)\n\n    # Single Holding Slot at bottom\n    slot_y = note_y + 68\n    d.text((W // 2 - 115, slot_y - 20), \"📥 1 SLOT CHỜ DUY NHẤT (Cùng màu)\", fill='#bbf7d0', font=font_badge)\n    slot_w, slot_h = 150, 68\n    sx = (W - slot_w) // 2\n    d.rounded_rectangle([sx, slot_y, sx + slot_w, slot_y + slot_h], radius=10, fill=PALETTE['S']['fill'], outline='#ffffff', width=2)\n    d.text((sx + 14, slot_y + 14), \"Màu Da\", fill='#7c2d12', font=font_badge)\n    d.text((sx + 14, slot_y + 34), \"Đang gom tạm\", fill='#7c2d12', font=font_sm)\n    d.rounded_rectangle([sx + 92, slot_y + 16, sx + 138, slot_y + 46], radius=8, fill='#091e11', outline='#facc15', width=1)\n    d.text((sx + 99, slot_y + 20), \"4/8\", fill='#fef08a', font=font_card_num)\n\n    d.text((28, H - 38), \"• Ưu điểm Cách 2: Tranh độ phân giải tùy ý (10×10, 16×16), 5 cột dưới siêu to 68px!\", fill='#86efac', font=font_sm)\n\n    img.save(out_path, quality=95)\n\nbase_dir = r'C:\\Users\\Admin\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\0ca39d47-bf1d-4d04-97dc-9c2fe64cb8c8'\np1 = os.path.join(base_dir, 'demo_cach_1_6cols_pixel_pad.png')\np2 = os.path.join(base_dir, 'demo_cach_2_canvas_to_5cols.png')\n\nrender_cach_1(p1)\nrender_cach_2(p2)\nprint(\"SUCCESS:\", p1, os.path.getsize(p1))\nprint(\"SUCCESS:\", p2, os.path.getsize(p2))\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\0ca39d47-bf1d-4d04-97dc-9c2fe64cb8c8\\generate_both_demos.py"}}]}
